[Tips.雪（3D）]
effect.name=True 3D particles (snow, petals, dust, embers) drawn as camera-facing billboards under AviUtl2 Camera Control, with real-time 3D light-field and shadow coupling for Volumetric Light (3D) v3.16+.
粒子数=How many particles exist in the area at once (1-4000).
粒径=Diameter of one particle in pixels.
大きさのばらつき=Random variation of particle size (0-100%).
図形=Built-in or custom SVG/PNG AviUtl2 figure used as the particle texture.
エッジのぼかし=0 = draws the chosen figure as-is (keep at 0 for pre-softened SVGs). Above 0 applies a padded GPU Gaussian blur that preserves any custom/built-in shape outline while softening its edges; falls back to the original shape on error.
雪の色=Color tint applied to the particle texture.
初速X=Initial velocity along X. Positive = right, negative = left.
初速Y=Initial velocity along Y. Positive = downward (snow), negative = upward (embers/fireflies).
初速Z=Initial velocity along Z. Positive = away from camera, negative = toward camera.
初速のばらつき=Cone spread angle around the initial velocity vector (0-85 degrees).
重力=Acceleration along Y. Positive = downward gravity, negative = upward lift.
風X=Constant wind drift along X. Positive = right.
風Y=Constant wind drift along Y. Positive = down.
風Z=Constant wind drift along Z. Positive = away from camera.
揺れ幅=Amplitude of left-right / front-back swaying in pixels.
揺れ速さ=Frequency of swaying in cycles per second (Hz).
回転速度=billboard rotation speed of each particle (degrees per second).
領域の余裕=Extra margin added around the frame when Sync to Frame Size is active (0-200%, default 20%).
幅(X)=Width of the box-shaped emission area along X.
高さ(Y)=Height of the emission area along Y; also used for automatic lifetime.
奥行き(Z)=Depth of the emission area along Z; larger values create deeper foreground/background parallax.
中心X=X offset of the emission area center relative to this object.
中心Y=Y offset of the emission area center relative to this object.
中心Z=Z offset of the emission area center relative to this object.
画面サイズに同期=Locks area width and height to the project frame dimensions so particles fill any resolution.
壁を画面の外へ=Automatically expands the wrap box from camera focal length and distance so wrap seams stay off-screen.
カメラに追従=Moves the active emission box with the camera target so particles never run out of view.
世界座標に固定=Keeps particles anchored in world space with modulo tiling around the moving camera for true 3D parallax.
折り返しのぼかし=Soft fade width near wrap boundaries as a multiple of particle size (30-50 hides wrap seams cleanly).
領域の枠を表示=Draws a cyan 3D wireframe box of the emission volume for layout; turn off before rendering.
移動時間から自動=Computes particle lifetime automatically from initial velocity, box size, and gravity.
生存時間=Manual particle lifetime in seconds (used when Auto from Travel Time is off).
出現フェード=Fade-in duration at birth as a percentage of lifetime.
消滅フェード=Fade-out duration before death as a percentage of lifetime.
奥行き減衰=Aerial-perspective fade applied to distant particles for depth sense.
近景カット=When on, particles closer than Near Cull Distance smoothly fade out via a smoothstep ramp so lens-hugging flakes never block the frame or flicker.
近景カット距離=Camera view-space distance where opacity reaches zero; full opacity restores at 1.6x this distance (typical: 100-300 px).
奥行き順に描画=Sorts particles back-to-front by camera depth so semi-transparent overlaps blend accurately.
ログに描画モードを出力=Logs active render mode (soft-vertex / figure-texture / flat-circle) plus particle and vertex counts on mode change.
乱数シード=Seed value changing the deterministic initial distribution of particles.
体積光に照らされる=Receives the shared 3D light field from Volumetric Light (3D) v3.16+ in the same scene: particles inside beams glow and automatically stay unlit inside 3D/2D cast shadows or behind foreground masks (zero overhead when no beam is active).
受光の強さ=Illumination intensity applied to particles inside unoccluded volumetric beams (0-300%, default 120%).
光色の染まり=How strongly illuminated particles absorb the local beam color (including multi-color stained glass): 0% keeps snow color, 100% uses full beam color.
光束外・影の減光=Dims ambient particles outside the beam and inside 3D/2D cast shadows when an active Volumetric Light is present (0-100%; 90-100% creates pure Tyndall dust motes visible only inside lit shafts).
発光の広がり=Forward-scattering halo size multiplier for illuminated particles (100-280%, default 135%).
